          "name": "Patience of Nature (Ex)",
          "level": 2,
          "type": "archetype",
          "summary": "An ancient guardian does not gain wild empathy at 1st level. Instead, at 2nd level, an ancient guardian adds Diplomacy, Perform (oratory), and Sense Motive to her list of class skills and gains an insight bonus equal to half her druid level on such checks. This ability replaces wild empathy.",
